# Design-review evidence is regenerable by tools/, so it stays local. Without
# this, docs/ held 239 files / 60 MB of which exactly one was tracked, and a
# single `git add -A` committed 63 MB of screenshots. The batch README.md files
# remain trackable because they are the actual written record.
docs/**/*.png
docs/**/*.log

# Agent skill bundles installed by `uipro init --ai universal --global`, and the
# project-scoped variant. Reproducible on any machine; ~4 MB each.
.opencode/
